{"id":"vod_sn_36013","vodId":"36013","provider":"sn","providerName":"索尼资源","type":2,"name":"校园迷糊大王","name_cn":"校园迷糊大王","date":"2004-01-01","year":"2004","region":"jp","area":"日本","platform":"日韩动漫","remarks":"已完结","images":{"common":"https://snzypic.vip/upload/vod/20230911-1/52b30452dbccc2e37a0d5ccb2efda0fd.jpg"},"summary":"冢本天满（小清水亚美 配音）是一名个性迷糊的高中生，她的性格向上生活也充满了欢乐。只是，单纯的天满心里有一个名叫乌丸大路（小西辽生 配音）的暗恋对象，这让乐观的她偶尔的有些苦恼。乌丸大路顶着西瓜头，成绩优秀运动万能，可是看似完美的他却有着怪异的行为和只属于自己的秘密，身患绝症的他即将不久于人世。外表狂野个性粗暴的播磨拳儿（高桥广树 配音）内心有着柔软天真的一面，这一面的名字叫做天满，可是天然呆的天满似乎从未注意到过他的感情。当他鼓起勇气对天满表白时候，出现在眼前的女子，却是个性直爽的学院偶像泽近爱理（堀江由衣 配音）。面对播磨火辣的表白，泽近爱理的心里产生了异样的感情。　　在矢神高中里，迷糊而快乐的校园生活每日都在上演。","rating":{"score":0},"tags":[{"name":"日本动画"}],"sourceType":"third-party","updatedAt":"2023-09-11 15:39:37","playable":true,"episodeCount":26,"classic":true,"playGroups":[{"name":"snm3u8","episodes":[{"name":"第01集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/97PNjd5Byi1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第02集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/F2VzcHgPsd1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第03集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/N9FAvbS3b31/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第04集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/xSMHiuiX7B1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第05集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/M1uHzLRNXr1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第06集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/9zryukbSDm1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第07集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/49UgnBepgN1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第08集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/VGpG2EQhvi1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第09集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/1cAeQejjpx1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第10集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/HDhU3hsQt01/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第11集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/T0hDJqFenG1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第12集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/wj7iEiCQsP1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第13集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/xpYb1bLYfH1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第14集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/4Gw2esRjMG1/vid